{"id":"4009987846320499973","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"I was at Phoebe Bridgers last night. I wore heels. I watched the first few songs sitting down. I noticed the girl in front of me was also sitting, and her friends were all standing. I thought nothing of it. Then Lost Boys came on. People are dancing…not the girl in front of me. Her friend looked at her with a confused look, then looked at me. I then realized…she was sitting BECAUSE OF ME! I was so sad. I proceeded to tell her that if she wants to stand, PLEASE STAND! ENJOY THE CONCERT!","username":"diggety12","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@diggety12/post/DemVrNNkS0F","timestamp":"2026-10-17T14:37:04Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-17T19:15:45.780410627Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-17T19:15:51.887395Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-17T19:15:51.887395Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_3d38900bdf6dd97a","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
